  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skatteverket-Kenya Revenue Authority f&#xf6;rberedande</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swe Tax Agency-Kenya Revenue Authority preparatory</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta avser en f&#xf6;rberedande insats f&#xf6;r ett eventuellt                 institutionssamarbete mellan kenyanska och svenska skatteverken.      Insatsen &#xe4;r en tj&#xe4;nstek&#xf6;ps&#xf6;verenskommelse under Sidas ramavtal med    skatteverket. Syftet &#xe4;r att bed&#xf6;ma m&#xf6;jligheterna till samarbete,      identifiera relevanta omr&#xe5;den samt utveckla ett programdokument.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This concerns a preparatory contribution for a possible institutional cooperation between the Kenya Revenue Authority and the Swedish Tax   Agency. The contribution is a call off from Sida&apos;s framework          agreement with STA. The purpose is to assess the possibilities for    cooperation, identify relevant areas and develop a program document.</narrative>
  </description>
